{"id":"5e4a2bb3a72820fb","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-no-ce-complement-conversion.md","title":"不能统一从有限集枚举索引得到补集枚举索引","display":"thm-no-ce-complement-conversion — 不能统一从有限集枚举索引得到补集枚举索引","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-no-ce-complement-conversion","aliases":["20-thm-no-ce-complement-conversion"],"display":"thm-no-ce-complement-conversion — 不能统一从有限集枚举索引得到补集枚举索引","chapter":"2","section":"2.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Corollary 2.3.4 的有限集反例","source_printed_pages":[34],"source_pdf_pages":[70],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-thm-recursion]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-no-ce-complement-conversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-no-ce-complement-conversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-no-ce-complement-conversion — 不能统一从有限集枚举索引得到补集枚举索引"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Corollary 2.3.4 的有限集反例"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>34</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>70</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathcal C_1\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"416559051d6f8f46\" href=\"?note=416559051d6f8f46\" title=\"20-thm-recursion\">20-thm-recursion</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no\\text{-}ce\\text{-}complement\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\neg\\forall e\\ [|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\Rightarrow\\exists j\\ (\\theta(e)\\downarrow=j\\land W_j=\\omega\\setminus W_e)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no\\text{-}ce\\text{-}complement\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\neg\\forall e\\ [|W_e|&lt;\\omega\\Rightarrow\\exists j\\ (\\theta(e)\\downarrow=j\\land W_j=\\omega\\setminus W_e)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>反设存在 θ。用递归定理构造 W_n：等待 θ(n)=j，再等待 0∈W_j；成功才枚举 0。W_n 恒为 ∅ 或 {0}，因此 θ(n) 必须停止。若等待永不成功，W_n=∅ 要求 W_j=ω，矛盾；若成功，0 同时在 W_n 和其所谓补集中，仍矛盾。此论证连有限集 promise 下也排除了转换。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 2.3.4 的有限集反例；印刷页 34；PDF 第 70 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-recursion]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-recursion","status":"resolved","id":"416559051d6f8f46","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-thm-recursion]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathcal C_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}no\\text{-}ce\\text{-}complement\\text{-}conversion}\\vdash\n\\neg\\forall e\\ [|W_e|<\\omega\\Rightarrow\\exists j\\ (\\theta(e)\\downarrow=j\\land W_j=\\omega\\setminus W_e)].","display":true}],"bytes":1537,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","416559051d6f8f46","8ba6597a854c206f","e343870c773cb68e"]}